    "tpa_score_new": "<div>出席及缺席：<br />\n登記為曠課者，曠課一次扣「課程出席」成績3分。<br />\n學生請假依本校學生請假辦法辦理，務必要在上課之前，檢附請假理由及文件，線上提出申請。<br />\n&nbsp;<br />\n課堂互動與參與討論：<br />\n在上課之前請預習課本，以便上課時參與討論。<br />\n&nbsp;<br />\n如果出現學習上的困難，如跟不上學習進度、聽不懂，請儘早與老師聯繫，以幫助您找到解決方案。</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": "<div>Exam: Multiple choice questions and short description questions.</div>\n\n<div>Class Participation: Please read the weekly readings before class in order to be able to participate in class discussions.</div>\n\n<div>Class Presentation: Report.</div>\n\n<div>Course Attendance: (1)Students who are recorded as absent without leave will have 2 points deducted from their &quot;Course Attendance&quot; for each instance of absence.&nbsp; (2) Students requesting leave must follow the school&#39;s procedures for requesting leave. It is imperative to submit the leave reason and documents before class starts, and to apply online.</div>\n",
    "course_pol": "這堂課的修習人數比較多，還請尊重他人，並以合理、負責和禮貌的態度行事。\n上課時請勿聊天、睡覺或做其他非本課程相關事務，除進行討論外，否則請盡量不要打擾他人。\n當其他同學提問時，請專心地聆聽。當您發言時，請面對自己的小組或全班同學大聲說話，讓同學能聽清楚。",
    "course_pol_en": "Please respect others and behave in a reasonable, responsible and polite manner.\nDuring class, please refrain from chatting or engaging in irrelevant activities unless you are participating in group discussions. \nWhen a classmate is giving an oral presentation or asking a question, listen carefully. When presenting your own slides, face your group or the whole class and speak clearly so that your classmates can hear you.",
    "course_rem": "請益時間的說明：\n課堂上會公佈我的每週請益時間，如有任何關於課程的問題，\n歡迎寄封電子郵件給我預約討論時間。",
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>學習必須以誠信為基礎，在作業、測驗或考試中作弊或抄襲的學生或協助他人的行為，該次成績以零分計，若是累犯，將依逢甲大學學生獎懲辦法提送。<br />\n(考核時如果您抄襲他人的答案、或交作業時您交出全部或部分由他人撰寫的論文或作業，則被視為作弊。)</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>關於口頭報告：<br />\n請認真遵守撰寫內容和想法來源的標準原則。如果您使用了其他作者的內容或想法，請確認這些用語或想法的來源，並在報告中標註這些素材的出處。<br />\n與同學合作以完成書面報告是學習的有效途徑，但是當您撰寫文章時，請確保文字是您自己的。<br />\n任何以您的名義提交的測試、論文或報告都被認為是您自己的原創作品，請勿提交曾在其他課程中提交過的作業。<br />\n&nbsp;<br />\n如果你不知如何完成作業，請與授課教師聯繫，切勿抄襲或作弊，我們可以一起找出幫助你的辦法。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>In the case of cheating or plagiarism in exams, whether by the student themselves or by assisting others, a score of zero will be recorded for that instance.</div>\n\n<div>If you complete your oral presentation through plagiarism, your assignment will be marked zero.</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>If you are unsure how to do a presentation, please do not attempt plagiarism. You can contact me and we can discuss a solution to help you complete it.</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
